CCTPBridgeModule_SetDomainConfig
├── when caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── when mintRecipient is bytes32(0)
│   └── it should revert with CCTPBridgeModule_ZeroMintRecipient
├── when minFinalityThreshold is not 1000 or 2000
│   └── it should revert with CCTPBridgeModule_InvalidFinalityThreshold
├── when all parameters are valid with empty hook data
│   ├── it should store the domain config
│   ├── it should set isValid to true
│   ├── it should emit DomainConfigSet
│   └── it should be retrievable via getDomainConfig
├── when all parameters are valid with non-empty hook data
│   ├── it should store hookData in the domain config
│   └── it should emit DomainConfigSet
├── when updating an existing domain config
│   ├── it should overwrite the previous config
│   └── it should emit DomainConfigSet with new values
├── when configuring multiple domains
│   └── it should store each domain independently
└── fuzz
    └── when minFinalityThreshold is not 1000 or 2000
        └── it should revert with CCTPBridgeModule_InvalidFinalityThreshold
